 "MNIST", "context": "As a result, using CNNs to accomplish error-free MNIST recognition remains difficult, and there really is no methodology which can reach a 100% classification performance for distinct character traits.", "mentionContextAttributes": {"used": {"value": false, "score": 0.30664461851119995}, "created": {"value": false, "score": 0.49680906534194946}, "shared": {"value": false, "score": 0.19654631614685059}}, "documentContextAttributes": {"used": {"value": true, "score": 0.9091967940330505}, "created": {"value": true, "score": 0.7006649971008301}, "shared": {"value": false, "score": 0.19654631614685059}}}, {"rawForm": "MNIST database", "type": "dataset-name", "dataset-name": {"rawForm": "MNIST database", "normalizedForm": "MNIST database", "offsetStart": 0, "offsetEnd": 14, "boundingBoxes": [{"p": 5, "x": 91.8988, "y": 691.245, "w": 73.96600000000001, "h": 9.928899999999999}]}, "normalizedForm": "MNIST database", "context": "MNIST database is one of the foremost classical imaging datasets within the field of machine learning, and is broadly utilized for benchmarking in image classification.", "mentionContextAttributes": {"used": {"value": false, "score": 0.16748714447021484}, "created": {"value": true, "score": 0.7447031140327454}, "shared": {"value": false, "score": 0.08780970424413681}}, "documentContextAttributes": {"used": {"value": true, "score": 0.8326011300086975}, "created": {"value": true, "score": 0.7447031140327454}, "shared": {"value": false, "score": 0.08780970424413681}}}, {"rawForm": "MNIST database", "type": "dataset-name", "dataset-name": {"rawForm": "MNIST database", "normalizedForm": "MNIST database", "offsetStart": 4, "offsetEnd": 18, "boundingBoxes": [{"p": 5, "x": 418.447, "y": 704.172, "w": 78.2758, "h": 9.928899999999999}]}, "normalizedForm": "MNIST database", "context": "The MNIST database contains 60,000 training samples and 10,000 testing samples (Table ), each consisting of a 28*28 pixel grayscale image of a handwritten Arabic digit.", "mentionContextAttributes": {"used": {"value": true, "score": 0.8326011300086975}, "created": {"value": false, "score": 0.12216240912675858}, "shared": {"value": false, "score": 0.04523651674389839}}, "documentContextAttributes": {"used": {"value": true, "score": 0.8326011300086975}, "created": {"value": true, "score": 0.7447031140327454}, "shared": {"value": false, "score": 0.08780970424413681}}}, {"rawForm": "MNIST", "type": "dataset-name", "dataset-name": {"rawForm": "MNIST", "normalizedForm": "MNIST", "offsetStart": 11, "offsetEnd": 16, "boundingBoxes": [{"p": 6, "x": 71.9984, "y": 363.957, "w": 33.7603, "h": 9.9289}]}, "normalizedForm": "MNIST", "context": "Since the MNIST is a grayscale image dataset, the color channel for each image is 1 (3 for RGB images).", "mentionContextAttributes": {"used": {"value": true, "score": 0.9091967940330505}, "created": {"value": false, "score": 0.05398087948560715}, "shared": {"value": false, "score": 0.03682224079966545}}, "documentContextAttributes": {"used": {"value": true, "score": 0.9091967940330505}, "created": {"value": true, "score": 0.7006649971008301}, "shared": {"value": false, "score": 0.19654631614685059}}}, {"rawForm": "MNIST handwritten dataset", "type": "dataset-name", "dataset-name": {"rawForm": "MNIST handwritten dataset", "normalizedForm": "MNIST handwritten dataset", "offsetStart": 97, "offsetEnd": 122, "boundingBoxes": [{"p": 7, "x": 366.62, "y": 142.571, "w": 120.69241249999999, "h": 9.928899999999999}]}, "normalizedForm": "MNIST handwritten dataset", "context": "This shows that the learning rate decay can effectively improve the recognition accuracy of the MNIST handwritten dataset.", "mentionContextAttributes": {"used": {"value": false, "score": 0.47534430027008057}, "created": {"value": false, "score": 0.41492384672164917}, "shared": {"value": false, "score": 0.10973186045885086}}, "documentContextAttributes": {"used": {"value": false, "score": 0.47534430027008057}, "created": {"value": false, "score": 0.41492384672164917}, "shared": {"value": false, "score": 0.10973186045885086}}}, {"rawForm": "MNIST dataset", "type": "dataset-name", "dataset-name": {"rawForm": "MNIST dataset", "normalizedForm": "MNIST dataset", "offsetStart": 130, "offsetEnd": 143, "boundingBoxes": [{"p": 10, "x": 178.295, "y": 132.592, "w": 66.7234125, "h": 9.928899999999999}]}, "normalizedForm": "MNIST dataset", "context": "This study elaborates the details of developing a light-weight DNN for handwriting digital recognition/ classification using the MNIST dataset.", "mentionContextAttributes": {"used": {"value": false, "score": 0.1951514482498169}, "created": {"value": true, "score": 0.7979815602302551}, "shared": {"value": false, "score": 0.006867002695798874}}, "documentContextAttributes": {"used": {"value": true, "score": 0.6423917412757874}, "created": {"value": true, "score": 0.7979815602302551}, "shared": {"value": false, "score": 0.007143273018300533}}}, {"rawForm": "MNIST \\ndataset", "type": "dataset-name", "dataset-name": {"rawForm": "MNIST \ndataset", "normalizedForm": "MNIST dataset", "offsetStart": 154, "offsetEnd": 168, "boundingBoxes": [{"p": 10, "x": 506.369, "y": 171.427, "w": 33.7592, "h": 9.9289}, {"p": 10, "x": 72.0011, "y": 184.41, "w": 28.626412499999997, "h": 9.9289}]}, "normalizedForm": "MNIST dataset", "context": "The developed neural network model is evaluated upon Keras/ Tensorflow framework, and the overall accuracy of the developed model can reach 99.4% on the MNIST dataset, compatible with the results from other state-of-the-art models.", "mentionContextAttributes": {"used": {"value": true, "score": 0.6423917412757874}, "created": {"value": false, "score": 0.3504650294780731}, "shared": {"value": false, "score": 0.007143273018300533}}, "documentContextAttributes": {"used": {"value": true, "score": 0.6423917412757874}, "created": {"value": true, "score": 0.7979815602302551}, "shared": {"value": false, "score": 0.007143273018300533}}}], "references":